ownload flow is unchanged, and the suite passes against a conforming `Response` on both runtimes.\n\n**Fix, nothing asserted less**\n- The stub now returns `new Response('a,b' + CRLF, …)` with a string body.\n- The `createObjectURL` assertion previously required a `Blob` (jsdom's). It now accepts the jsdom or the Node `Blob` and also checks `blob.size > 0`.\n\n**Result**\n\n| Runtime | Test files | Passed | Skipped | Failed |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Node 22.23.3 | 11 | 87 | 1 (Playwright e2e) | 0 |\n| Node 24.21.0 | 11 | 87 | 1 (Playwright e2e) | 0 |\n\nLint and typecheck are clean. \"CI round 2\" is appended to `audit.md` and `mailbox.md`. No database or MinIO was needed for the web suite, so nothing needed stopping.","s":false},"signals":{"tool_error":21},"tainted_tools":22,"n_tool_calls":257,"scrub_hits":{"high_entropy":3}}